title=Kitbashing+Guide%3A+Build+Unique+Sci-Fi+Miniatures&slug=kitbashing-guide&content=%3Ch1%3EKitbashing+Guide%3A+Build+Unique+Sci-Fi+Miniatures%3C%2Fh1%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EShort+answer%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Kitbashing+means+combining+parts+from+different+kits+to+build+a+model+nobody+can+buy.+Start+with+a+donor+model%2C+harvest+%22bitz%22+from+a+spares+box%2C+cut+and+pin+the+joins%2C+fill+the+gaps%2C+and+%E2%80%94+most+importantly+%E2%80%94+keep+the+silhouette+balanced%3A+one+dominant+element%2C+two+supporting+elements%2C+everything+else+subordinate.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EDisclosure%3A+Some+links+on+this+page+are+affiliate+links+%E2%80%94+if+you+buy+through+them%2C+we+may+earn+a+small+commission+at+no+extra+cost+to+you.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EWhat+Is+Kitbashing+%E2%80%94+and+Where+to+Find+Spare+Parts%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EKitbashing+%28building+%22conversions%22%29+is+taking+parts+from+multiple+kits+%E2%80%94+and+scratch-made+pieces+%E2%80%94+to+create+a+unique+model.+Sources+for+parts%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EYour+spares+box%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+every+kit+you%27ve+ever+built+left+useful+leftovers+%E2%80%94+weapons%2C+heads%2C+shields%2C+antennae%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESwap+events+and+club+nights%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+bitz+trading+is+a+hobby+tradition%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESecond-hand+lots%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+buying+a+cheap+bulk+lot+of+half-built+models+is+a+parts+goldmine%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3E3D-printed+bits%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+single+parts+printed+at+home+fill+any+gap%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EEveryday+objects%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+beads%2C+buttons%2C+springs%2C+watch+parts+%E2%80%94+the+original+kitbasher%27s+secret%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EEssential+Tools%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EHobby+knife%3C%2Fstrong%3E+with+fresh+blade+%E2%80%94+clean+cuts%2C+no+crushed+plastic%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPlastic+cement%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%28welds+plastic+together%3B+stronger+than+glue%29%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESuper+glue%3C%2Fstrong%3E+for+resin+and+metal+parts%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EGreen+stuff%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%28two-part+epoxy+putty%29+for+gap-filling+and+sculpting%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPin+drill+%2B+wire%3C%2Fstrong%3E+for+strong+joins+on+heavy+parts%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESide+cutters+and+needle+files%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Ch2%3ECutting%2C+Pinning+and+Gap-Filling%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Col%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ECut%3C%2Fstrong%3E+parts+off+sprues+with+flat+surfaces+%E2%80%94+clean+joins+are+half+the+job%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ETest-fit+before+cement.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Plastic+cement+is+permanent+within+seconds%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPin+heavy+parts%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+drill+a+hole+in+both+halves%2C+insert+a+wire+segment%2C+then+cement+%E2%80%94+gravity+is+a+strong+enemy%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EFill+gaps%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+press+green+stuff+into+seams%2C+smooth+it+with+a+wet+sculpting+tool%2C+let+it+cure+overnight%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ERe-scribe+panel+lines%3C%2Fstrong%3E+across+filled+areas+so+the+repair+disappears%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Fol%3E%0A%3Ch2%3ECreating+Silhouette+Balance+on+Converted+Models%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EA+kitbash+fails+or+succeeds+at+the+silhouette+stage.+The+rule%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EOne+dominant+element%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+the+oversized+feature+that+defines+the+model+%28a+huge+weapon%2C+a+banner%2C+a+mech+arm%29%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ETwo+supporting+elements%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+secondary+additions+that+echo+the+theme%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EEverything+else+subordinate%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+small+details+that+reward+close+viewing%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cp%3EIf+three+elements+fight+for+dominance%2C+remove+one.+Squint+at+the+model%3A+if+the+silhouette+is+clear+and+interesting%2C+the+conversion+works.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3ERecommended+Hobby+Kits+and+Tools%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cfigure+class%3D%22wp-block-table%22%3E%3Ctable%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%3EItem%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EWhy%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3ELevel%3C%2Fth%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Fthead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EHobby+starter+tool+set%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EKnife%2C+cutters%2C+files+in+one+buy%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EBeginner%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EGreen+stuff+%282-part+putty%29%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EGap-filling+and+sculpting%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EAll%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EPin+drill+set%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EStrong+joins+for+heavy+bitz%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EIntermediate%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ESpares%2Fbitz+assortment+packs%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EInstant+parts+library%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EAll%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Ftbody%3E%3C%2Ftable%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3E%28Affiliate+links+%E2%80%94+buying+through+them+supports+more+guides.%29%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EFAQ%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EIs+kitbashing+expensive%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EIt%27s+the+cheapest+way+to+unique+models+%E2%80%94+most+bitz+come+from+kits+you+already+own.+The+tool+investment+%28~%2430%E2%80%9350%29+is+the+only+real+cost.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWill+kitbashed+models+be+tournament-legal%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EUsually+yes+if+dimensions+stay+honest+and+the+model+clearly+represents+what+its+rules+say.+Check+event+policies+for+proxies.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ECan+I+mix+plastic%2C+resin+and+metal+parts%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EYes+%E2%80%94+but+use+the+right+glue+for+each+join+and+pin+resin-to-plastic+joins%3B+super+glue+alone+fails+on+heavy+parts.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow+do+I+learn+what+parts+fit+together%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EBuild+one+conversion+from+one+donor+kit+with+only+weapon+swaps+first.+Scale+awareness+grows+with+every+project.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EContinue+on+the+Workbench%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Fbest-hobby-tools%2F%22%3EBest+Hobby+Tools+for+Miniature+Painting%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+the+tooling+behind+clean+conversions%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2F3d-printed-terrain%2F%22%3E3D+Printed+Terrain+for+Tabletop+Games%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+print+your+own+bitz%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Feasy-weathering-techniques%2F%22%3EEasy+Weathering+Techniques%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+unify+kitbashed+parts+with+grime%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Flore%2Fchaotic-factions%2F%22%3EThe+Fractured+Factions+of+the+Warpstorm%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+lore+to+inspire+your+next+conversion%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EYour+spares+box+is+an+unopened+army.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Build+one+conversion+this+month+%E2%80%94+even+a+single+weapon+swap+counts.+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fshop%2Ftools%2F%22%3EGet+the+kitbashing+tool+set+%E2%86%92%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%3Cem%3E%28affiliate+links%29%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E&status=publish